RNS Buffer public API dry observation, 2026-09-27
Command: crates/retinue/oracle/.venv/Scripts/python.exe -u - (stdin script below)
No link, socket, or Cargo process in this probe. A fake Channel records only successful public send(message) calls.
Script:
import RNS
class C:
    mdu = 431
    def __init__(self): self.frames = []
    def is_ready_to_send(self): return True
    def send(self, message):
        packed = message.pack()
        self.frames.append((bool(packed[0] & 128), bool(packed[0] & 64), len(packed)-2))
        return None
channel = C()
writer = RNS.Buffer.create_writer(0, channel)
print(RNS.__version__, writer.write(b'rns-compressed-eof:' + b'Z'*320))
writer.close()
print(channel.frames)
